{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>38歲的前港姐朱千雪今天（11日）在社交平台報喜，宣布第二胎出世，組四口之家。朱千雪分享初生BB溫馨熟睡相，BB包住粉紅色毛巾，旁邊擺放向日葵及太陽花針織公仔，朱千雪起初寫了\"Mom again\"並附上紫色心心emoji，後來編輯字眼變成\"Parents again\"，不少圈中人留言祝福包括楊秀惠﹑江美儀﹑鄧卓殷﹑傅嘉莉和王君馨等。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:58:20.605801+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T12:28:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T17:55:58.141517+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:51:53.218748+00:00","content_hash":"604f0ee4fad408efe4198ac63cd05efdffabe62bc2ca1204ce8104fac9d86dd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}